# No duplicate logic

If the same behavior already exists, call that function. Do not paste a second copy into the file you are writing.

Before adding a helper, search for it. Event label color on a type color is `textOnTypeColor` in `apps/web/src/schedule/textOnTypeColor.ts`. Use that for every booking, chip, and drag card.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — the lightness check copied again
const lightness = Number(typeColor.match(/oklch\(\s*([\d.]+)/)?.[1] ?? 0);
const textOnColor = lightness > 0.72 ? 'text-[#201e1d]' : 'text-white';

// ✅ GOOD
const textOnColor = textOnTypeColor(typeColor);
```

When a new behavior is needed in more than one place, add one function and import it. Do not leave the first copy inline and rewrite it nearby.
